+From 03cc8f08dc167db318005cfc9cbb0ad3057dbdc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Elfbot <elfbot@elfhosted.com>
+Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 14:41:21 +1300
+Subject: [PATCH] perf: ElfHosted CPU optimization patches rebased onto v2.53.0
+
+Rebased all CPU optimization patches from v2.52.0 to v2.53.0, adapting
+for upstream column renames (parsed_json, sources_json, updated_at,
+aliases_json), table renames (media_metadata_cache), new schema migration
+system, and Rust-powered torrent-parse-rank dependency.
+
+Includes fix for unbounded Redis debrid cache growth (per-hash keys
+with individual TTL instead of single hash).
+
+Removed pre-cap ranking optimization (RANK_CANDIDATE_MULTIPLIER) as the
+Rust-backed RTN makes it unnecessary.
+
+Fix Jinja2 template cache crash on Python 3.13 (unhashable dict in
+LRU cache key).
